<title>USA: Corcom to repurchase up to 200,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Corcom to repurchase up to 200,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>LIBERTYVILLE, Ill. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corcom Inc said Wednesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 200,000 shares.</p>
<p>The repurchases will be made form time to time, depending on market conditions, in the open market and in privately negotiated transactions, it said.</p>
<p>The company, which makes electronic filters and power entry components, has about 3.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
